1997 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Facebook\057 Instagram IC7 Product Designer Jan \055 Dec 2018\nI was brought into the Building 8 Group \050R\046D\051 to invent new products for theoretical hardware device categories rolling out in 2024\056 My day to day involved going from 10\054000 feet up strategy down to hands on prototyping\056 I made 30\053 prototypes for a projected AR device\054 working closely with engineering\054 hardware and leadership\056 )
