1999 0 obj
  << /ActualText (WeeShip Product Designer\054 Founder Dec 2014 \055 Jan 2018\nIn 2014 I started a Design Studio with some friends\056 I learned a ton about building a business and managing relationships in a short amount of time\056 We were able to touch dozens of projects some highlights are\072 \nNavdy wanted to build what can best be described as Google Glasses for your car\056 I designed and built the first UX prototype that Doug \050CEO\051 took out for raising \0446\0569m and supported them as they became more real\054 helping them staff and grow helping them eventually raise \04433m\nWonder Workshop set out in building a toy for teaching kids ages 3yr\053 the fundamentals of programing and came to us to build an interface\056 It was challenging\056 I lead every aspect of the interface and user journey from concept to V1\054 overseeing all engineering development\056 The work I did with them lead to \0446\0569m in funding which then later let them raise \04478\0569 million in funding \nIntel\057GE I worked with a joint marketing team to concept\054 design\054 animate and code animations for the launch of an effort to reduce electricity needs of devices\056 The campaign generated 2\0567million interactions across multiple platforms\056\nNike I was subcontracted to design and develop dozens of animations for the Nike Fuel Band leading to creation of the \034Goal\035 animations that ended up driving much of the success of the product\056 )
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 2000 0 R
     /Pg 1994 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

