2001 0 obj
  << /ActualText (JP Morgan Chase VP of Design Jan 2011 \055 Jan 2014\nAt JPMC I was brought in to pave the future of mobile banking\056 I worked closely with executives across many devisions of the business to build some amazing products\056 I helped scale the team from 2 to 40\053 and was awarded 3 US patents for interactions and survived one of the most political corporate structures in the world\056 )
     /K [ 2 ]
