  << /ActualText (Disney Interactive Lead UX UI  Designer 2010 \055 2011\nAfter Taptap sold to Disney\054 I was given much more responsibility\054 leading projects like \034Wheres My Water\077\035 and Cars 2 which held records like \034Only app to go \0431 on top free and grossing at the same time\056\035  )
