2005 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Tapulous \050Acquired by Disney\051 Lead Designer 2009 \0552010\nI initially joined the Taptap team as a contractor\054 contributing to ideas and graphics\056 Later\054 I became a full\055time employee as the franchise was expanding\056 I acquired extensive knowledge during my time there\054 too much to list\056 I worked closely with the leadership team to come up with new ideas\054 grow the apps we had in place and most of all how to have fun at work\056)
